## 2. D-2: Shared Adapter Types & Per-View Re-Export Strategy

### 2.1 Architectural Placement (Resolving Q2 and Q3)

- **Q2 Placement:** Day interaction handlers are decomposed under `packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/interactions/`, mirroring `packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/interactions/` 1:1, rather than being prematurely hoisted into the generic grid layer.
- **Q3 Placement:** Shared interaction adapter type definitions are located at `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/adapter.types.ts`. Executable adapter lifecycle helpers are placed in `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/adapter.helpers.ts`.

### 2.2 Shared Generic Target Contracts

Declared in `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/adapter.types.ts`:

```typescript
import type { DateColumnKey, DayColumnKey } from "@core/types/domain-primitives";
import type { GridInteractionVisual } from "../types";

export interface GridAllDayDragTarget<TRegistered> {
  type: "all-day-drag";
  target: TRegistered;
}

export interface GridAllDayResizeTarget<TRegistered> {
  type: "all-day-resize";
  target: TRegistered;
  edge: "start" | "end";
}

export interface GridTimedDragTarget<TRegistered> {
  type: "timed-drag";
  target: TRegistered;
}

export interface GridTimedResizeTarget<TRegistered> {
  type: "timed-resize";
  target: TRegistered;
  edge: "start" | "end";
}

export type GridInteractionTarget<TRegistered> =
  | GridAllDayDragTarget<TRegistered>
  | GridAllDayResizeTarget<TRegistered>
  | GridTimedDragTarget<TRegistered>
  | GridTimedResizeTarget<TRegistered>;

export type GridResolvedEventTarget<TRegistered> = {
  target: TRegistered;
  interactionType: "all-day-drag" | "all-day-resize" | "timed-drag" | "timed-resize";
  edge?: "start" | "end";
};
```

### 2.3 Shared Non-Generic Value Types

```typescript
export interface GridAllDayDragCommitResult {
  type: "all-day-drag";
  handled: boolean;
}

export interface GridAllDayResizeCommitResult {
  type: "all-day-resize";
  handled: boolean;
}

export interface GridTimedDragCommitResult {
  type: "timed-drag";
  handled: boolean;
}

export interface GridTimedResizeCommitResult {
  type: "timed-resize";
  handled: boolean;
}

export type GridInteractionCommitResult =
  | GridAllDayDragCommitResult
  | GridAllDayResizeCommitResult
  | GridTimedDragCommitResult
  | GridTimedResizeCommitResult;

export interface GridInteractionPointerOwnership {
  isPointerDown: boolean;
  activePointerId: number | null;
  hasCapture: boolean;
}
```

### 2.4 Per-View Re-Export Strategy & Backward Compatibility

- **Week (`packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/week-interaction.adapter.types.ts`):**
  - Re-exports aliases: `WeekAllDayDragTarget = GridAllDayDragTarget<WeekRegisteredEventTarget>`, `WeekTimedDragTarget = GridTimedDragTarget<WeekRegisteredEventTarget>`, etc.
  - Retains view-specific structures: `WeekInteractionRuntime`, `WeekInteractionAdapterOptions`, `WeekInteractionAdapter`, `WeekEdgeNavigableVisual`, and `rebuildLayoutAfterNavigation`.
- **Day (`packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/day-interaction.adapter.types.ts`):**
  - Re-exports aliases: `DayAllDayDragTarget = GridAllDayDragTarget<DayRegisteredEventTarget>`, `DayTimedDragTarget = GridTimedDragTarget<DayRegisteredEventTarget>`, etc.
  - Retains view-specific structures: `DayInteractionRuntime`, `DayInteractionAdapterOptions`, `DayInteractionAdapter`.
- **External Consumers:** All 25 external import sites across the codebase remain completely intact with zero import churn.

