## 3. End-to-End Type-Flow Analysis

### 3.1 Type-Flow Chain

1. **Ingestion & Cache Construction:**
   - `GridLayoutCacheOptions<TColumnKey>.visibleDates: TColumnKey[]`
   - `buildTimedGridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>(...)`, `buildAllDayGridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>(...)`, `buildDragGridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>(...)`
   - Output: `GridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>` containing `dayColumns: DayColumnCache<TColumnKey>[]`, where each column carries `date: TColumnKey`.
2. **Math & Drag Spatial Projection:**
   - `math/timed.drag.ts` and `math/all-day.drag.ts` execute column snapping and project target column: `dayDate: nextColumn?.date ?? visual.dayDate`.
   - Visual state types: `TimedDragVisual<TColumnKey>.dayDate: TColumnKey` and `AllDayDragVisual<TColumnKey>.dayDate: TColumnKey`.
3. **Commit Stage Dispatch:**
   - `GridInteractionVisual<TColumnKey>` is routed to view commits.
   - **Week Commit (`packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/commit/*.commit.ts`):** Operates on `DateColumnKey` (`DateOnly`), executing date-delta math and invoking `grid/interaction/commit/cross-row.commit.ts` (pinned to `DateColumnKey`).
   - **Day Commit (`packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/commit/*.commit.ts`):** Operates on `DayColumnKey` (`CalendarId | DateOnly`), routing through `columnMoveCalendarId` to associate moves with target calendars.

### 3.2 Target Declarations to Modify

| File Path | Target Declarations to Modify |
| :--- | :--- |
| `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/layout.cache.ts` | `GridLayoutCacheOptions<TColumnKey = string>`, `DayColumnCache<TColumnKey = string>`, `GridLayoutCache<TColumnKey = string>`, `BuildDayColumnsInput<TColumnKey = string>`, `buildTimedGridLayoutCache`, `buildAllDayGridLayoutCache`, `buildDragGridLayoutCache`, `buildDayColumns`, `getNearestDayColumn` |
| `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/timed-drag.types.ts` | `TimedDragVisual<TColumnKey = string>`, `TimedDragMathResult<TColumnKey = string>` |
| `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/all-day-drag.types.ts` | `AllDayDragVisual<TColumnKey = string>`, `AllDayDragMathResult<TColumnKey = string>` |
| `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/visual.types.ts` | `GridInteractionVisual<TColumnKey = string>` |
| `packages/web/src/grid/interaction/commit/cross-row.commit.ts` | Pin explicit signatures to `DateColumnKey` (`DateOnly`) |
| `packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/commit/timed.commit.ts` | Update `columnMoveCalendarId` parameter to accept `DayColumnKey` |
| `packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/commit/*.commit.ts` | Explicitly bind visual parameter types to `DateColumnKey` |

